# ---- CI Run4 复盘补充 ----
# curl: KOS README Ubuntu 验证清单明确列出 (kosctl/平台服务运行需要), 此前遗漏
# libonnxruntime-dev: KOS_BUILD_SPATIAL=ON (README: "打包与 CI 用这个") 强制构建
#   景深引擎, 硬依赖 OpenCV+ONNX Runtime; trixie 有 1.21.0 (apt-cache policy 实证)
# ---- kosctl install apps (Calendar/Todo/Weather/Music) 依赖 ----
# 依据 apps/README.zh-CN.md: kcalendarcore(GStreamer)(TagLib) 由音乐/日历/待办使用
qt6-multimedia-dev
libgstreamer1.0-dev
libgstreamer-plugins-base1.0-dev
libtag1-dev
# ---- 本地 chroot configure 实证补充 (trixie 环境全绿验证发现) ----
# libpolkit-agent-1-dev: Quickshell src/services/polkit 的 pkg_check_modules(polkit-agent-1) 硬依赖
# qt6-*-private-dev: Quickshell 使用 Qt6 私有 API (QtQuick/6.8.2 等版本化私有头目录),
#   Debian 将私有头拆分为独立包, 不装则 Generate step 报 INTERFACE_INCLUDE_DIRECTORIES 失效
libpolkit-agent-1-dev
qt6-base-private-dev
qt6-declarative-private-dev
qt6-quick3d-private-dev
qt6-svg-private-dev
qt6-wayland-private-dev
